mapping "X0802.1" source="X0802" target="217176002" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source X0802 = SNOMED CT 217176002 (Swedish national extension). Base X08 Athena-crosswalks to
        SNOMED CT 432504 (concept_code 217176002) via ICD10 relationship 45756367 -> 432504. The Swedish
        extension subdivides the base event by a place/activity/qualifier axis with no distinct standard
        SNOMED CT clinical analogue; the underlying clinical event is unchanged. Target subsumes the source
        event -> broader. Confidence : verified Athena crosswalk on base X08, one-level broader (Swedish
        qualifier dropped).
        """
}
